      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Frontend SPA (React)\n\n- GuestRoute / ProtectedRoute\n- auth-store boots from localStorage\n- GET /auth/me on app mount\n- Axios uses withCredentials=true\n- 401 -> one POST /auth/refresh retry\n- 25 min proactive refresh timer\n- Google OAuth starts here",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Frontend SPA (React)\n\n- GuestRoute / ProtectedRoute\n- auth-store boots from localStorage\n- GET /auth/me on app mount\n- Axios uses withCredentials=true\n- 401 -> one POST /auth/refresh retry\n- 25 min proactive refresh timer\n- Google OAuth starts here",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 211
    },
